ode, and 4 mode-specific execution workflows. Always use this skill when the user wants to generate video from reference media via the dreamina command line.", "description_zh": "Provides comprehensive guidance for executing image-to-video (图生视频) generation via the dreamina CLI for 即梦. This skill covers 4 sub-commands selected by input type: image2video (1 image → animate), frames2video (2 images → transition via --first/--last), multiframe2video (2-20 storyboard images → narrative via --images and --transition-prompt), and multimodal2video (up to 9 images + 3 videos + 3 audio → synthesis). Use when the user has reference images or media files and wants to generate video via CLI; mentions \\\"dreamina image2video\\\", \\\"图生视频CLI\\\", \\\"frames2video\\\", \\\"multiframe2video\\\", \\\"multimodal2video\\\"; or provides media files and asks to animate or synthesize them. This skill covers mode detection with a decision tree, parameter name differences between sub-commands, input limits per mode, and 4 mode-specific execution workflows. Always use this skill when the user wants to generate video from reference media via the dreamina command line.", "downloads": 72, "homepage": "https://api.skillhub.cn/user_c1d16043/jimeng-cli-image2video", "iconUrl": "https://cloudcache.tencent-cloud.com/qcloud/ui/static/other_external_resource/a4e49550-e527-4406-b761-c4f2e607b757.png", "installs": 0, "labels": {"requires_api_key": "false"}, "name": "即梦-图生视频 CLI 技能，让你的智能体通过 即梦 CLI 生成视频", "ownerName": "user_c1d16043", "score": 1234.567901234568, "slug": "jimeng-cli-image2video", "source": "community", "stars": 0, "tags": null, "updated_at": 1780854827145, "version": "1.0.0"}, {"category": "", "created_at": 1779415896581, "description": "Search and download free novel TXT files from public sources.", "description_zh": "搜索并下载免费小说 TXT 文件，支持中文/英文小说，自动检测编码", "downloads": 72, "homepage": "https://api.skillhub.cn/user_f60a6fb7/novel-txt-finder", "iconUrl": "https://cloudcache.tencent-cloud.co